    <title>[ADIF Guest Blog] From studio to industry: ADIF 2026 charts a path to job creation in Africa&#039;s creative industries</title>
    <link>https://www.uneca.org/stories/%5Badif-guest-blog%5D-from-studio-to-industry-adif-2026-charts-a-path-to-job-creation-in-africa</link>
    <description>&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-date field-type-datetime field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;date-display-single&quot; property=&quot;dc:date&quot; datatype=&quot;xsd:dateTime&quot; content=&quot;2026-06-17T00:00:00+03:00&quot;&gt;17 June, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-slider-image field-type-image field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;img typeof=&quot;foaf:Image&quot; class=&quot;img-responsive&quot; src=&quot;https://www.uneca.org/sites/default/files/styles/slider_image/public/storyimages/ECA_1101_1920x640.png?itok=2p9CdnDj&quot; alt=&quot;[ADIF Guest Blog] From studio to industry: ADIF 2026 charts a path to job creation in Africa&amp;#039;s creative industries&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rrssb&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rrssb-prefix&quot;&gt;Share this:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;rrssb-buttons&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;rrssb-facebook&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.uneca.org%2Fstories%2F%255Badif-guest-blog%255D-from-studio-to-industry-adif-2026-charts-a-path-to-job-creation-in-africa&quot; class=&quot;popup&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rrssb-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 29 29&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M26.4 0H2.6C1.714 0 0 1.715 0 2.6v23.8c0 .884 1.715 2.6 2.6 2.6h12.393V17.988h-3.996v-3.98h3.997v-3.062c0-3.746 2.835-5.97 6.177-5.97 1.6 0 2.444.173 2.845.226v3.792H21.18c-1.817 0-2.156.9-2.156 2.168v2.847h5.045l-.66 3.978h-4.386V29H26.4c.884 0 2.6-1.716 2.6-2.6V2.6c0-.885-1.716-2.6-2.6-2.6z&quot;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rrssb-text&quot;&gt;facebook&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;rrssb-twitter