    <title>Africa&#039;s youth take centre stage on day one of the inaugural Africa Development Impact Forum</title>
    <link>https://www.uneca.org/stories/africa%27s-youth-take-centre-stage-on-day-one-of-the-inaugural-africa-development-impact-forum</link>
    <description>&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-date field-type-datetime field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;date-display-single&quot; property=&quot;dc:date&quot; datatype=&quot;xsd:dateTime&quot; content=&quot;2026-06-11T00:00:00+03:00&quot;&gt;11 June, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-sub-title field-type-text field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;From financial architecture to AI, entrepreneurship and trade, a day of bold ideas, frank dialogue and nine innovators competing to transform Africa&amp;#039;s jobs crisis&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-slider-image field-type-image field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;img typeof=&quot;foaf:Image&quot; class=&quot;img-responsive&quot; src=&quot;https://www.uneca.org/sites/default/files/styles/slider_image/public/storyimages/ECA_6141_1920x640.png?itok=j7yEwMDO&quot; alt=&quot;Africa&amp;#039;s youth take centre stage on day one of the inaugural Africa Development Impact Forum&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rrssb&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;rrssb-prefix&quot;&gt;Share this:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;rrssb-buttons&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;rrssb-facebook&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.uneca.org%2Fstories%2Fafrica%2527s-youth-take-centre-stage-on-day-one-of-the-inaugural-africa-development-impact-forum&quot; class=&quot;popup&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rrssb-icon&quot;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 29 29&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M26.4 0H2.6C1.714 0 0 1.715 0 2.6v23.8c0 .884 1.715 2.6 2.6 2.6h12.393V17.988h-